##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
[`57`] is [`57`] units away from [`0`] on a number line, so [`\abs{57}=57\text{.}`] Another way to think about this is that the "positive version" of [`57`] is [`57\text{.}`]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

